# A CALLERROR with `null` where Part 4 §4.2.3 asks for an ErrorDescription string, and one
# with the empty string the specification allows. The frame parser reads a description that
# is not a string as empty rather than refusing the error, so both pass in both modes
# (frame parsing has no lenient mode).
> [2,"1","GetVariables",{"getVariableData":[{"component":{"name":"SynthController"},"variable":{"name":"Uptime"}}]}]
< [4,"1","InternalError",null,{}]
> [2,"2","GetVariables",{"getVariableData":[{"component":{"name":"SynthController"},"variable":{"name":"Uptime"}}]}]
< [4,"2","InternalError","",{}]
